UNIT @3:1
  PROG PROGRAM ROUNDS @3:1
    DIVN IDENTIFICATION @3:1
      IDPA PROGRAM-ID ROUNDS @4:1
      IDPA OPTIONS @5:1
    DIVN DATA @8:1
      SECT WORKING-STORAGE @9:1
        DATA 1 RESULT @10:1
          CLAU PICTURE 9(3) @10:25
    DIVN PROCEDURE @11:1
      SENT @12:5
        STMT COMPUTE @12:5
        STMT DISPLAY @13:5
        STMT STOP @14:5
